+
+Generated cases are deterministic in differential.py:
+- every list of lengths 0 through 6 over the alphabet {-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3};
+- 5,000 pseudorandom lists using Random(0x3B3E10), lengths 0 through 80,
+  with values uniformly drawn from [-10^12, 10^12].
