+The dry run exited 0. The proof then exited 1 with `WarnStuckClaimState` at a
+reachable final `<k> false </k>` while the mutation required `true`. Logs:
+`06-false-postcondition-dry-run.log` and `06-false-postcondition-proof.log`.
